  m_text: "Before the sunrise, shoot a sequence of colours towards the unlit candles.
    Beside them a body lies, that of your dearest companion. \n\nThe pattern changes
    every night, so ensure to enter it right. Peak inside your friend's leftover
    bits, for a helping a hand."
